flowchart TD
  W[Post request] --> PS[Post service]
  PS --> P[(Posts<br/>by author)]
  PS -- PostCreated --> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> FO[Fan-out workers<br/>skip celebrities and inactive users]
  FO --> G[(Follow graph)]
  FO --> FC[(Feed cache<br/>Redis sorted sets of post ids)]
  R[Feed request] --> FS[Feed service]
  FS --> FC
  FS -. pull celebrity posts .-> P
  FS --> RK[Ranking]
  FS --> H[Hydrate: posts · authors · counts]
  H --> CDN[Media via CDN]
